{"id":2753,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>1月13日下午，我院联合数学学院在经管学院301会议室举办华彩讲坛，本次讲坛由山西省民政事业发展中心苏顺生书记主讲，我院研究生参加。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gUlCL4nmTVnNr7MMNMfnRf2oRvPLlroRnzNaUmv8LllsUm90gihFp2hmCIa0nShRn1y8USh7oRTfM4LiMzMVM8liozNYLm7iU4GPMmCaUNWFn7VVLN7YnzrFMNlaLRNJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C4MRlJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6345&e=.png\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/ECF4AD89A73553E7E5992215C01660BB/DAE2A2E5/6E009\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 519px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gUlCL4nmTVnNr7MMNMfnRf2oRvPLlroRnzNaUmv8LllsUm90gihFp2hmCIa0nShRn1y8USh7oRTfM4LiMzMVM8liozNYLm7iU4GPMmCaUNWFn7VVLN7YnzrFMNlaLRNJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C4MRlJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6345&e=.png\"></p><p>苏书记从历史方位、发展实际与人民需求三方面解读社会民生的深刻变化，剖析政府、企业、社会组织与个人在民生领域的责任与短板。他结合人口老龄化、社会救助体系与社会工作等现实问题，探讨当前民生工作面临的挑战与务实举措，并围绕二十届四中全会关于就业、教育、社保、医疗等领域的政策导向，阐释民生改革的实施路径。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gLz9LDnzMfM8liLMNlPoRAfUmLZU47osn7lsLlnVMRfVnzN0gihFp2hmCIa0MShVMkhRMYyDn7CPU8W2L8CbL4UanR9YLRl8L46kLz9anznFolLDMmWVMmnFM8lPU8lJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C4MRlJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6345&e=.png\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/5E4C76DF1CBF3F9340D8205437B180E4/9C662E64/7E1CE\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 535px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gLz9LDnzMfM8liLMNlPoRAfUmLZU47osn7lsLlnVMRfVnzN0gihFp2hmCIa0MShVMkhRMYyDn7CPU8W2L8CbL4UanR9YLRl8L46kLz9anznFolLDMmWVMmnFM8lPU8lJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C4MRlJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6345&e=.png\"></p><p>本次讲座有助于我院学生系统认识社会民生，激发责任意识与担当精神。未来，我院师生将持续关注社会发展与心系民生福祉，以专业知识与社会责任感服务国家进步，实现个人价值。</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gUlCL4nmTVnNr7MMNMfnRf2oRvPLlroRnzNaUmv8LllsUm90gihFp2hmCIa0nShRn1y8USh7oRTfM4LiMzMVM8liozNYLm7iU4GPMmCaUNWFn7VVLN7YnzrFMNlaLRNJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C4MRlJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6345&e=.png"}